  "decision_conditions": [
    "Prior the commencement of the development, excluding enabling works and demolition, if any, a Flood Risk Assessment (FRA) shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority (LPA). The FRA shall assess the risk of flooding from all potential sources, including (but not limited to): fluvial, surface water, groundwater, sewer, and artificial sources. The approved FRA shall identify any necessary mitigation measures and provide details of its author and their flood related expertise and qualifications. The development shall thereafter be carried out and maintained in full accordance with the approved FRA and identified mitigation measures.\r\n\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development avoids or reduces contributing to all sources of flooding."
